  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let equation of hyperbola is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> It passes through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Equation of directrix is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>, given in question.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>And we know that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> From&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math></p>"
